---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Link from "../../components/Link.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Autowealth + CompoundFox — Algo trading platform with live dashboard | Alejandro Martínez"
  description="Built CompoundFox algorithmic trading strategy with a live, public performance dashboard. Full equity curve, Sharpe and drawdown updated in real time. Autowealth is the SaaS distribution layer: Turborepo monorepo with backend, Telegram bot, Next dashboards, React Native, and AWS CDK."
>
  <div class="page">

    <!-- top bar -->
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="topbar-left">
        <span class="topbar-name">alejandro martinez</span>
        <span class="topbar-path">/ work / autowealth</span>
      </div>
      <nav class="topbar-nav">
        <Link href="/">← back</Link>
        <Link href="/#case-studies">case studies</Link>
        <Link href="mailto:alex@konar.es">contact</Link>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- hero -->
    <div class="hero">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-tag">CASE STUDY · 06</div>
        <div class="hero-main">
          <div class="hero-meta">ALGORITHMIC TRADING · DISTRIBUTION PLATFORM &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2024 — now &nbsp;·&nbsp; SOLE ENGINEER</div>
          <h1 class="hero-h1">CompoundFox strategy with a live, public performance dashboard.</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">
            Autowealth is a SaaS distribution platform for algorithmic trading strategies. CompoundFox
            is the flagship strategy — full equity curve, Sharpe ratio and drawdown updated in real time
            on a public dashboard. The platform includes a Turborepo monorepo with backend, Telegram bot,
            Next.js dashboards, React Native mobile app, and AWS CDK infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <div class="hero-links-label">LINKS</div>
          <Link href="https://autowealth.trade" class="hero-link">autowealth.trade ↗</Link>
          <Link href="https://stats.autowealth.trade" class="hero-link">stats.autowealth.trade ↗</Link>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- numbers strip -->
    <div class="numbers">
      <div class="numbers-cell">
        <div class="numbers-key">STRATEGY</div>
        <div class="numbers-val">CompoundFox</div>
        <div class="numbers-sub">flagship algorithm</div>
      </div>
      <div class="numbers-cell">
        <div class="numbers-key">DASHBOARD</div>
        <div class="numbers-val">live</div>
        <div class="numbers-sub">equity curve · sharpe · drawdown</div>
      </div>
      <div class="numbers-cell">
        <div class="numbers-key">PLATFORM</div>
        <div class="numbers-val">SaaS</div>
        <div class="numbers-sub">distribution layer for strategies</div>
      </div>
      <div class="numbers-cell">
        <div class="numbers-key">MONOREPO</div>
        <div class="numbers-val">Turborepo</div>
        <div class="numbers-sub">backend · bot · dashboards · mobile</div>
      </div>
      <div class="numbers-cell">
        <div class="numbers-key">INFRA</div>
        <div class="numbers-val">AWS</div>
        <div class="numbers-sub">CDK · ECS · CloudWatch</div>
      </div>
      <div class="numbers-cell numbers-cell--last">
        <div class="numbers-key">STRATEGIES</div>
        <div class="numbers-val">3+</div>
        <div class="numbers-sub">CompoundFox · AlgoAI · Forex</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- the brief -->
    <Section tag="THE BRIEF" title="A trading strategy with proof.">
      <p class="body-para">
        The core challenge was transparency: traders need to see real performance before committing
        capital. Autowealth solves this with a live, public dashboard that shows the full equity curve,
        Sharpe ratio and drawdown for CompoundFox — updated in real time. The platform extends beyond
        a single strategy: it's a distribution layer that can host multiple algorithms (CompoundFox,
        AlgoAI, Forex), each with its own performance tracking and follower management.
      </p>
    </Section>

    <!-- architecture -->
    <Section tag="ARCHITECTURE" title="Turborepo monorepo: backend, bot, dashboards, mobile.">
      <pre class="arch-diagram">  ┌─ Turborepo monorepo
  │
  ├── apps/
  │   ├── backend              [ Bun · TypeScript · Jesse (backtesting) ]
  │   │      Bybit API integration · trade execution · performance calculation
  │   │
  │   ├── telegram-bot         [ Telegraf · TypeScript ]
  │   │      strategy signals · performance alerts · follower management
  │   │
  │   ├── dashboard            [ Next.js 14 · React Query · shadcn/ui ]
  │   │      live equity curve · Sharpe · drawdown · real-time metrics
  │   │
  │   └── mobile               [ React Native ]
  │          strategy overview · performance charts · notifications
  │
  └── infra/
       └── aws-cdk             [ TypeScript · ECS · CloudWatch · RDS ]
              auto-scaling · monitoring · blue/green deploys
</pre>
    </Section>

    <!-- decisions -->
    <Section tag="DECISIONS" title="Four calls that define the platform.">
      <div class="decisions-grid">
        <div class="decision">
          <div class="decision-tag">01 &nbsp;·&nbsp; DECISION</div>
          <div class="decision-title">Live public dashboard as trust signal</div>
          <p class="decision-body">Instead of periodic performance reports, the dashboard shows real-time equity curves, Sharpe ratio and drawdown. This is the primary trust signal for potential followers — they can verify the strategy's performance before committing any capital. The metrics update continuously from the live trading engine.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="decision">
          <div class="decision-tag">02 &nbsp;·&nbsp; DECISION</div>
          <div class="decision-title">Turborepo monorepo over separate repos</div>
          <p class="decision-body">The backend, Telegram bot, dashboard and mobile app share code (performance calculations, API clients, types). Turborepo provides shared dependencies, incremental builds and a single deployment pipeline. This keeps the platform consistent and reduces maintenance overhead across four apps that need to stay in sync.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="decision">
          <div class="decision-tag">03 &nbsp;·&nbsp; DECISION</div>
          <div class="decision-title">Strategy-agnostic distribution layer</div>
          <p class="decision-body">Autowealth is designed as a distribution platform, not a single-strategy product. CompoundFox is the first strategy, but the architecture supports adding new algorithms (AlgoAI, Forex) without changing the platform. Each strategy has its own performance tracking, risk metrics and follower management, while sharing the same distribution infrastructure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="decision">
          <div class="decision-tag">04 &nbsp;·&nbsp; DECISION</div>
          <div class="decision-title">Bybit as primary exchange</div>
          <p class="decision-body">Bybit provides the most reliable API for the trading strategies used, with deep liquidity and competitive fees. The platform uses Bybit's WebSocket API for real-time market data and REST API for trade execution. This choice simplifies the architecture by focusing on one exchange first, with plans to support additional exchanges in the future.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>

    <!-- ownership -->
    <Section tag="OWNERSHIP" title="The full stack: backend, bot, dashboards, mobile, infra.">
      <div class="ownership">
        <div class="ownership-header">
          <span>COMPONENT</span>
          <span>STACK</span>
          <span class="text-right">ROLE</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership-row">
          <span class="ownership-repo">Trading backend</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim">bun · typescript · jesse · bybit api</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim text-right">sole</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership-row">
          <span class="ownership-repo">Performance engine</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim">equity curve · sharpe · drawdown · real-time</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim text-right">sole</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership-row">
          <span class="ownership-repo">Next.js dashboard</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim">next.js 14 · react query · shadcn/ui</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim text-right">sole</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership-row">
          <span class="ownership-repo">Telegram bot</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim">telegraf · typescript · strategy signals</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim text-right">sole</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership-row">
          <span class="ownership-repo">React Native mobile</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim">react native · performance charts · notifications</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim text-right">sole</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ownership-row">
          <span class="ownership-repo">AWS infrastructure</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim">typescript · aws cdk · ecs · cloudwatch</span>
          <span class="ownership-dim text-right">sole</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>

    <!-- outcome -->
    <Section tag="OUTCOME" title="A production trading platform with real-time transparency.">
      <p class="body-para">
        Autowealth is a production trading platform that combines a live algorithmic strategy with
        transparent performance tracking. The public dashboard provides real-time equity curves,
        Sharpe ratio and drawdown — the primary trust signals for potential followers. The Turborepo
        monorepo architecture keeps the backend, bot, dashboards and mobile app in sync, while the
        strategy-agnostic design allows new algorithms to be added without platform changes.
      </p>
    </Section>

    <!-- next case -->
    <div class="next-case">
      <span class="next-case-label">NEXT CASE STUDY</span>
      <Link href="/cases/copy-trader" class="next-case-link">
        05 &nbsp; Copy Trader — Multi-exchange copy trading engine →
      </Link>
    </div>

    <!-- footer -->
    <footer class="footer">
      <span>alejandro martinez · @lyricalstring · oss under konar technologies</span>
      <span>alex@konar.es</span>
    </footer>

  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    max-width: 1280px;
    padding: 28px 32px 56px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ── TOP BAR ── */
  .topbar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .topbar-left {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .topbar-name {
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .topbar-path {
    color: var(--faint);
  }

  .topbar-nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 28px;
  }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    padding-top: 88px;
    padding-bottom: 80px;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 280px;
    gap: 32px;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .hero-meta {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }

  .hero-h1 {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin: 20px 0 0;
    max-width: 880px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .hero-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-top: 24px;
    max-width: 680px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .hero-links {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .hero-links-label {
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .hero-link {
    display: block;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  /* ── NUMBERS STRIP ── */
  .numbers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .numbers-cell {
    padding: 24px 16px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .numbers-cell--last {
    border-right: none;
  }

  .numbers-key {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .numbers-val {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .numbers-sub {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--faint);
    margin-top: 4px;
  }

  /* ── BODY PARA (brief + outcome) ── */
  .body-para {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 640px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── ARCHITECTURE DIAGRAM ── */
  .arch-diagram {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.85;
    background: #101216;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 24px 28px;
    max-width: 760px;
    white-space: pre;
    overflow-x: auto;
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ── DECISIONS ── */
  .decisions-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px 56px;
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .decision-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .decision-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .decision-body {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--dim);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-top: 8px;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* ── OWNERSHIP TABLE ── */
  .ownership {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dim);
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .ownership-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 2fr 1fr;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  .ownership-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2fr 2fr 1fr;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .ownership-repo {
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  .ownership-dim {
    color: var(--dim);
  }

  .text-right {
    text-align: right;
  }

  /* ── NEXT CASE ── */
  .next-case {
    margin-top: 88px;
    padding-top: 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
  }

  .next-case-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .next-case-link {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--fg);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 120ms ease;
  }

  .next-case-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  .footer {
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding-top: 24px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
</style>
